=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ WGET @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt GNU Wget @VERSION@ for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt GNU Wget is free software under the GNU General Public License v3 or later.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [WGET.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for GNU Wget
    At system startup: to define WGET$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:WGET$STARTUP.COM
    For each user: to define the wget command, add this line to LOGIN.COM:
    $ @WGET$ROOT:[000000]WGET$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE WGET removes the product and deassigns WGET$ROOT.
